@architecture

Purpose:
  System architecture references.

Use this index before choosing an architecture style.

Styles:
  @architecture.layered
      Traditional layered architecture.

  @architecture.hexagonal
      Ports and adapters, dependency inversion.

  @architecture.clean
      Entities, use cases, interface adapters, frameworks.

  @architecture.modular-monolith
      Single deployable unit with internal module boundaries.

  @architecture.microservices
      Distributed services with independent deployment.

  @architecture.event-driven
      Communication through events.

DecisionGuide:
  TeamSize < 5, Domain simple?
    → @architecture.layered

  Need testability and framework independence?
    → @architecture.hexagonal

  Need strict dependency rules and enterprise scale?
    → @architecture.clean

  Single team, need internal boundaries?
    → @architecture.modular-monolith

  Multiple teams, independent deployability?
    → @architecture.microservices

  Need async communication and loose coupling?
    → @architecture.event-driven

RelatedReferences:
  @ddd
  @patterns.repository
  @database.transaction

State: +
